      "name": "Breather",
      "type": "physicalTech",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Ideal for Mars and exoplanets where you need air but not a full vacsuit, breathers consist of a face masks and a backpack or side pouch unit. It converts carbon dioxide into breathable oxygen indefinitely. For environments without convertible CO2 atmospheres (such as Titan), a small air tank provides 2 hours of breathable air.</p>",
